@startuml
actor "Head of Department" as HOD
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Review Dashboard API" as API
participant "Scope Authorisation" as Auth
participant PostgreSQL as DB

HOD -> UI: Open Review oversight
UI -> API: GET department review dashboard
API -> Auth: Require review_dashboard.read for unit
Auth -> DB: Validate active role assignment and descendants
Auth --> API: Authorised scope
API -> DB: Aggregate cycles, tasks and findings for unit only
DB --> API: Counts
API --> UI: Active, pending, overdue and blocking summaries
@enduml
